abstract: "Open-source Windows controller for coordinated CaptureBridge Android video acquisition over authorized USB/ADB connections or a trusted private network, with shared session metadata, live preview, structured file transfer, visual boundary-timing diagnostics, and optional Arduino triggering of a laboratory reference system."
